WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:27.325
Tom was at the Royal Fair.

2
00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:34.335
"It's almost time for the joust, Cat," he whispered.

3
00:00:34.336 --> 00:00:38.702
The bad knight rode over to Tom.

4
00:00:38.703 --> 00:00:42.417
"I'm glad I won that free magic spell," he said.

5
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:47.983
"The prize money will be mine!"

6
00:00:47.984 --> 00:00:52.349
The joust began.

7
00:00:52.350 --> 00:01:05.971
Horses charged and lances clashed.

8
00:01:05.972 --> 00:01:08.594
Soon it was the bad knight’s turn.

9
00:01:08.595 --> 00:01:11.034
He rode toward another knight.

10
00:01:11.035 --> 00:01:17.625
Tom watched from his seat.

11
00:01:17.626 --> 00:01:24.024
Suddenly the bad knight’s horse swayed back and forth.

12
00:01:24.025 --> 00:01:26.747
"Uh-oh," cried Princess Mary.

13
00:01:26.748 --> 00:01:31.034
The bad knight dropped his lance!

14
00:01:31.035 --> 00:01:34.755
The other knight's lance struck the bad knight.

15
00:01:34.756 --> 00:01:41.492
Oof! The bad knight crashed to the ground.

16
00:01:41.493 --> 00:01:49.844
The other knight won the joust!

17
00:01:49.845 --> 00:01:55.888
"Our plan worked, Cat!" Tom whispered.

18
00:01:55.889 --> 00:02:01.453
The bad knight stomped toward Tom.

19
00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:05.039
"What happened, Wizard?" said the knight.

20
00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.413
"I was supposed to win!"

21
00:02:08.414 --> 00:02:12.569
"I still owe you one spell," said Tom.

22
00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:17.073
"Someday I'll do it, but I won't help you cheat!"

23
00:02:17.074 --> 00:02:19.668
Dirk was sitting nearby.

24
00:02:19.669 --> 00:02:25.181
"Cheat?" he cried. "Who's cheating?

25
00:02:25.182 --> 00:02:28.375
Cheaters go in the Grim Dungeon!"

26
00:02:28.376 --> 00:02:33.025
The knight gulped.

27
00:02:33.026 --> 00:02:36.077
"Um . . . Nobody's cheating!"

28
00:02:36.078 --> 00:02:38.306
He glanced at Tom.

29
00:02:38.307 --> 00:02:41.136
"I'll be back, Wizard!"

30
00:02:41.137 --> 00:02:51.556
Then the knight ran off.

31
00:02:51.557 --> 00:02:54.188
"Whew!" said Tom.

32
00:02:54.189 --> 00:02:57.236
"I'm glad he's gone, Cat."

33
00:02:57.237 --> 00:03:00.452
"Do you think he'll really come back?"

34
00:03:00.453 --> 00:03:03.779
Cat licked her paw.

35
00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:12.135
"Perhaps. Perhaps not."

